      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据公式(8-22)和(8-23)，匀强电场的电势为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$U=\\frac{E_P}{q}=Ed$. (8-24)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**电势差** 与电势能类似，在某点电势的数值决定于电势",
        "零点的选择. 某点的电势本身没有实际意义，而电势的变化",
        "量才有实际意义，它与电势零点的选择无关."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为电势能 $E_P=qU$，所以，功"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A=-(E_{P_2}-E_P)=-q(U_2-U_1)↵=-q\\Delta U$. (8-25)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "今后，我们将利用另外一个量——电势差，来代替电势的",
        "**变化量** $\\Delta U=U_2-U_1$，该变化量是在轨迹的终点和起点的电势",
        "的**数值**的差. 把轨迹的起点和终点的电势数值的差叫做电势",
        "差："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$V=U_1-U_2=-\\Delta U$. (8-26)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**通常**把电势差也叫做电压. 电压与电势的变化量的区别",
        "只差一个负号."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "特别是在研究电流的时候，用电势差或电压 $V$，比用电势",
        "的变化量要方便得多."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据(8-25)和(8-26)式，电势差"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$V=U_1-U_2=\\frac{A}{q}$. (8-27)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此可见，**两点间的电势差，或电压，$V=U_1-U_2$，等于电",
        "荷从起点移到终点电场所做的功**跟该电荷的电量的比值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "知道了照明电路中的电压，我们就知道了单位电荷沿",
        "着任意电路从一个结点移到另一个结点时电场所做的功. 在",
        "后面整个物理课程中，我们将经常碰到电势差的概念."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "· 176 ·"
      ]
    }
